      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْهَكٌ</span></b>  A horse <i>swift in running;</i> (S;) <i>that</i>

<i>runs much;</i> (K;) <i>that runs like the wind.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْهَجٌ</span>, q. v.,] <i>Eloquent,</i> or <i>fluent,
in speech; running therein like the wind;</i> (O, K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَهَّاكٌ</span></b> . (Kr, K.)

